{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Correction to the immediately preceding supplemental receipt. Two preserved-contract cells contained duplicated words introduced while posting. Disregard that preceding TSV and use this complete replacement. The evidence, citations, counts, and verdicts are unchanged.\n\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\ntests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py::D:<module>@1-32\t88c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#D:<module>@1-32\ta3072e39d9d33464d2d2a06e16bad3b4d7eccc58:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#D:<module>@1-32\tNon-editable installations can expose checkout and installed roots under one module namespace. Static and dynamic checks enforce the checkout root, and the split fixture exercises the detector in editable installations.\tPASS\t316\t105\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/implement_core_test_comments\ntests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py::C:<module>:before:_ALLOWED@52-55\t88c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#C:<module>:before:_ALLOWED@52-55\ta3072e39d9d33464d2d2a06e16bad3b4d7eccc58:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#C:<module>:before:_ALLOWED@52-55\tThe resolver test neither imports from the resolved root nor adds it to sys.path, so it cannot register rebar_reconciler from the installed root.\tPASS\t49\t25\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/implement_core_test_comments\ntests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py::D:test_no_test_module_resolves_the_installed_engine_root@80-85\t88c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#D:test_no_test_module_resolves_the_installed_engine_root@80-85\ta3072e39d9d33464d2d2a06e16bad3b4d7eccc58:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#D:test_no_test_module_resolves_the_installed_engine_root@80-85\tThe static test requires checkout-root resolution, while AST parsing prevents resolver names in comments and docstrings from becoming false positives.\tPASS\t44\t11\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/implement_core_test_comments\ntests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py::D:split_engine@138-143\t88c90f8b5abf4a80be3b1289d7719d6e03e29684:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#D:split_engine@138-143\ta3072e39d9d33464d2d2a06e16bad3b4d7eccc58:tests/unit/test_engine_root_convention.py#D:split_engine@138-143\tThe fixture creates a distinct engine root so foreign-registration detection runs even when an editable installation maps checkout and installed paths together.\tPASS\t52\t12\tPASS\tPASS\t/root/implement_core_test_comments"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788945460212064001,"uuid":"2fe062d5-d0d6-4eb1-9184-ccbab8385d20"}